<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Courses — LYCEE BATOURI</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/m1-preview.css"><script src="/js/canonical-courses.js" defer></script><%- include('partials/workspace-assets') %></head><body class="lms-ui "><header><a class="brand" href="/">LYCEE BATOURI <span>Courses and teaching</span></a><button id="logout">Sign out</button></header><main><%- include('partials/workspace-wayfinding',{workspaceMode:'School',workspaceHome:'/school'}) %><p id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section id="workspace" hidden><h1>Courses and teaching</h1><p id="year"></p><p>Your administrator must confirm current-year teaching assignments. Changing subject memberships does not transfer or promote pupils.</p><section id="admin" hidden><div class="panel"><h2>Add a class subject</h2><form id="offering-form" class="form-grid"><label>Class<select id="class" required></select></label><label>Subject<select id="subject" required></select></label><label>Offering coefficient<input id="coefficient" type="number" min="0.01" max="99.99" step="0.01" required></label><button>Create offering</button></form></div><div class="panel"><label>Subject offering<select id="offering"></select></label></div></section><div class="panel"><label>Term<select id="term"><option>First</option><option>Second</option><option>Third</option></select></label><button id="refresh" type="button">Refresh</button></div><div id="details"></div></section></main></body></html>
